{"id":"valentinstag","lemma":"Valentinstag","pos":"noun","rank":4552,"glosses":["Valentine's Day"],"ipa":"/ˈva.lɛn.tiːnsˌtaːk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/82/De-Valentinstag.ogg/De-Valentinstag.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Valentinstags","plural":"Valentinstage"},"examples":[{"text":"Heute ist Valentinstag.","en":"Today is Valentine's Day.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie war allein am Valentinstag.","en":"She was alone on Valentine's Day.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null]},{"text":"Ich wünschte, es wäre Valentinstag.","en":"I wish it was Valentine's Day!","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wish for","l":"wünschen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich wollte am Valentinstag nicht allein sein.","en":"I didn't want to be alone on Valentine's Day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"at the / on the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Dieses Jahr fällt Valentinstag auf einen Sonntag.","en":"This year, Valentine's Day falls on a Sunday.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"Sunday"}]}]}